      "text": "The first three terms combine to \\((4 + 3 + 2)(299)\\) \\(= 9 \\times 299 = 2691.\\)\n\nAdding the last term gives \\(2691 + 298 = 2989.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B .",
